      "parentFingerprint": "833eac9f34aa968a1d76e2f91c0c7bc0d6bc9d01656846751cbbc3727af8f887",
      "passageSha256": "b349576e1b270c249b17a27f3134e5164a4e85ccf6e4f32693ba4cd0fdef12c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p039-03600-s002",
      "sentenceText": "When he was nineteen, he went to India, spending seven months in search of a guru and spiritual enlightenment.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ddb813986d6eaf4644f63458cec1b59faaa93db34f50a1b418827373c0396765",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p039-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "833eac9f34aa968a1d76e2f91c0c7bc0d6bc9d01656846751cbbc3727af8f887",
      "passageSha256": "b349576e1b270c249b17a27f3134e5164a4e85ccf6e4f32693ba4cd0fdef12c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p039-03600-s005",
      "sentenceText": "But, he did gain a new perspective during his trip.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8c11139efd65e7ab3fa6edc468635b107b32ded9ba647b7db9e11c2aea22b672",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p039-03600-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "c13066ac18a984efc1654dfb07df7e13a6dfb84f4a0a5bb2cce1d7680b6f0794",
      "passageSha256": "9b5dccb23da7db02138074f67808987ee0d25f47e8ccccbe9af524f5e8615e64",
      "pdfPages": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p039-03600-s007",
      "sentenceText": "The people in the Indian countryside don’t use their intellect like we do, they use their intuition instead, and their intuition is far more developed than in the rest of the world….",
      "sentenceSha256": "5b9c28532c90af2e0929f6fa229240d39cc8a09ed4433e836784006b667c45ff",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p039-03600-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "c13066ac18a984efc1654dfb07df7e13a6dfb84f4a0a5bb2cce1d7680b6f0794",
      "passageSha256": "9b5dccb23da7db02138074f67808987ee0d25f47e8ccccbe9af524f5e8615e64",
      "pdfPages": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p039-05940-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Jobs eventually mastered how to use both his intellect and his intuition.",
      "sentenceSha256": "44c73735a4f01ab2a65a0ebae4157cea94e7a38a4370a58b08e23d5443c0cc5a",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p039-05940-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "794fd014cf2a38300e5216ed6577002783a9656e6a157720c305334dc2730bc0",
      "passageSha256": "80f71e5f6cdb367d82cf3250908439b28232ef9512221851385e064eb3a592d0",
      "pdfPages": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p039-05940-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Meanwhile, he bought Lucasfilm’s computer graphics division in January 1986.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b7da587b4375f83678eaa2c50c1deb979e4804aa74ee5f1ccd1c484624f9d80c",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p039-05940-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "c209b2966b5a954393868cf5988a73702af95eb9ff58d40a1b78010a77906256",
      "passageSha256": "3bc3dca48d8712f49cb80031f889e67b03abcd7d8893e53d00c5c1b2db3f30ae",
      "pdfPages": [
        39,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p039-05940-s008",
      "sentenceText": "In 1997, Jobs returned to Apple, and had a legendary run with the release of the iPod in 2001, the iMac in 2002, the iPhone in 2007, and the iPad in 2010.",
      "sentenceSha256": "60dbb64599d68a7108661350f3cc898d19ad28105db358b2527e0a1b04eda01f",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p039-05940-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "c209b2966b5a954393868cf5988a73702af95eb9ff58d40a1b78010a77906256",
      "passageSha256": "3bc3dca48d8712f49cb80031f889e67b03abcd7d8893e53d00c5c1b2db3f30ae",
      "pdfPages": [
        39,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Near the end of his life, Steve Jobs invited Ann Bower, who was Apple’s human resources director in the early 1980s, to his bedside.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e8be3ce43b98b0f6be35b10f89532f45f03389b46c0dbef0b32e4ccba148f370",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "41cab042ee3efab4a979fb12d16cbfba04ee31902fd77fe156abce75843f6545",
      "passageSha256": "eeedc83141bba1c16038f34e3230ce9689483405f3e7195c522d6e47a2c22c61",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-s002",
      "sentenceText": "He asked her, “Tell me, what was I like when I was young?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "c85f57e7b17314906f531ba287375868c92a90cc75b03d60079fa6f3a88b7c86",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "41cab042ee3efab4a979fb12d16cbfba04ee31902fd77fe156abce75843f6545",
      "passageSha256": "eeedc83141bba1c16038f34e3230ce9689483405f3e7195c522d6e47a2c22c61",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0057",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-s006",
      "sentenceText": "That turned out to be true.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "d0e26f9b09d74d38590faa0a3de5f03e40ae0338b070ad2f253f300d24f51d7f",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "1b56e4d383164e9f4f35a22b625a1fd3de25a6e5f487ad70f53e70c962244412",
      "passageSha256": "141ede20c63e7888657e0a5c016d4daa0c90a90de3143f4e7939a9b36d6ab292",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0058",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-s008",
      "sentenceText": "I really did.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "7b1c84c65ae98951b25fbd7298d2a529643f1033083e50f7c806c7db34dc8a50",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s04-p040-01725-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "1b56e4d383164e9f4f35a22b625a1fd3de25a6e5f487ad70f53e70c962244412",
      "passageSha256": "141ede20c63e7888657e0a5c016d4daa0c90a90de3143f4e7939a9b36d6ab292",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0059",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p040-04185-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Those are the stories of outwardly extraordinary, accomplished people.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ce34c2ad793ebd382347453a5a28ca8262f0ec7fd82a0e6ee5d17dd73c34bf04",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p040-04185-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "8d02591dd6003384e8e14431a918596487e255d90afcb0b38cadcc9be6c5c746",
      "passageSha256": "a393deb798b03165aceb890e0372ab384d603fb39edb98ce154da2c978f0ba69",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0060",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p040-04575-s002",
      "sentenceText": "She married in 1949 and raised three children there.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e69bda526454e6a24debdb17b62676b91021a0e914470c765baf1f6a3e7f214c",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p040-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "ebb298dcfe55c0de904282da8ce7d36b7db033e567fa036178f559de7bcbe5af",
      "passageSha256": "c0d1412eea2cb3735530c4ee1b62ee999f77c9bb7b2d4f9a99f9e9c5ad779085",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0061",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p040-04575-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Her simple life was marked by tragedies; her husband died of cancer in 1994, and a decade later she lost two of her adult children.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e26bce7b8a61d697add40c7fb63763ff916df689868136baa147418665aa94f9",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p040-04575-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-038",
      "parentFingerprint": "ebb298dcfe55c0de904282da8ce7d36b7db033e567fa036178f559de7bcbe5af",
      "passageSha256": "c0d1412eea2cb3735530c4ee1b62ee999f77c9bb7b2d4f9a99f9e9c5ad779085",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0062",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p040-05940-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Brad Ryan was thirty-four at the time.",
      "sentenceSha256": "729c14a229517b5e961a1e2e9ac26e86a65821352bbb879c70e080a5e460adf7",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p040-05940-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "0fbee493f54866e63ab95f5d03c1171ca1e99f52db72ea395f3f5f80445063d9",
      "passageSha256": "e1d2dc1fe6e6d5200feb2c927316a96fa3352ce256a7b433fc7fcf0a7bfd25c3",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0063",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p040-05940-s004",
      "sentenceText": "He had only recently started talking to her after a ten-year stretch of estrangement.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8ae4338c93c0ce9817a604539de3df34c7ebe31454480c27c0b999aecf80423b",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p040-05940-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-040",
      "parentFingerprint": "0fbee493f54866e63ab95f5d03c1171ca1e99f52db72ea395f3f5f80445063d9",
      "passageSha256": "e1d2dc1fe6e6d5200feb2c927316a96fa3352ce256a7b433fc7fcf0a7bfd25c3",
      "pdfPages": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0064",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p041-00750-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The phone call led Brad to a stunning revelation: in her eighty-five years, Joy had never seen a mountain or the ocean, much less a glacier or a desert, a bison or a whale.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8b3b378b508eb9d8c19745fbdf43e2094f47d0eb79f08791cc08f86826d454bb",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p041-00750-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a0b585f92c510e5bfa5b263fde16464761f23c0db3e1cdb40383e140db41e27",
      "passageSha256": "72aa7cd344f734b21f7d595e44adc64202000c618c40185f79c174867b429374",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0065",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p041-00750-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Joy became the oldest person to ever zipline in New River Gorge National Park in West Virginia.",
      "sentenceSha256": "38945531ecc5b0e38c02c52eb3d86435a604f3ecb24790e0d34a7ecc6dd9e527",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p041-00750-r003-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "35dd57751255348ef70206a81db4a25cb232f9a627469386067c6d21fe13daf5",
      "passageSha256": "34f12b8ae07f7d40cb3562a688f84759966dc618af4bad8e2419a66332aa4518",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0066",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p041-03090-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Joy’s life had been far from a psychologically rich one.",
      "sentenceSha256": "92c92fc42fde2216db29ab92749f975b4f745299ba6de8caf660d618f506c93c",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p041-03090-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "a0fd66912f73a827e2c8b4a0a280207392e7d76614c06149ba2bdac6deeee913",
      "passageSha256": "14997a7048f7cfc4e084fe51258fe45418173d220397ddf595a89efa3ec04f04",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0067",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p041-03090-s004",
      "sentenceText": "In her own words:",
      "sentenceSha256": "6556395d751d5bb2d06200dd0e46d20b80be2277bb7a5ade28368efa7d0fc74a",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p041-03090-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "a0fd66912f73a827e2c8b4a0a280207392e7d76614c06149ba2bdac6deeee913",
      "passageSha256": "14997a7048f7cfc4e084fe51258fe45418173d220397ddf595a89efa3ec04f04",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0068",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p041-04252-s001",
      "sentenceText": "It’s just hard to imagine all the beautiful, wonderful things that you find outside…it’s just been miraculous.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a9680c9c80aefcdc671cf3933d829a9408722d15aa23e648f46d2b3c715f24d8",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p041-04252-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "042890beb6a5f7889e4bd96ed9d32930db86487866662ae3cfa50972fcf33edb",
      "passageSha256": "b7fcd0d50f36cc7952470ef74990d851bade38d739cfa378fd8dfb97337b3c1e",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0069",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s05-p041-04252-s002",
      "sentenceText": "And I’ve enjoyed every minute of it….",
      "sentenceSha256": "f05de8c52ad65e98baf9f0266786f894a5a3075b67399d5238e38962d3bb0af0",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s05-p041-04252-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "042890beb6a5f7889e4bd96ed9d32930db86487866662ae3cfa50972fcf33edb",
      "passageSha256": "b7fcd0d50f36cc7952470ef74990d851bade38d739cfa378fd8dfb97337b3c1e",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0070",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-s001",
      "sentenceText": "On March 11, 2022, I was taking a taxi from my hotel in Riverside, California, to the airport.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c054829582a49a8d423fcb719525da23c906a5c8f9e2bd5b96fdcc2a801859ef",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "6155b9c89abbd0441efc8548e380b9430f8169fe36e020cc4819ab8df81ed2a2",
      "passageSha256": "dd2611192e44a31489a5b7de5ce0e69402fda72c729c4c26ce5beb941a03f86e",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0071",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The driver—I’ll call her Linda—told me her life story, and what a story that was.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2af4021643801dbdf0e62835ef64f2b3eefffd9486d5554f299119a9eba3ee13",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "6155b9c89abbd0441efc8548e380b9430f8169fe36e020cc4819ab8df81ed2a2",
      "passageSha256": "dd2611192e44a31489a5b7de5ce0e69402fda72c729c4c26ce5beb941a03f86e",
      "pdfPages": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0072",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-s003",
      "sentenceText": "She had worked for a county government and retired years before.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ca6c382a25a8b6590128b8b6befb16e9a2790afae5fcb327e01b0cfbf586bbd5",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-r001-004",
